@startuml gpioDriverStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Initialized
state InterruptConfigured

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Initialized : Init()\n[Initialize all pins]

Initialized --> Uninitialized : DeInit()\n[Clear all configs]

Initialized --> Initialized : ConfigurePin()\nSetMode()\nSetPull()\nSetSpeed()\nWritePin()\nReadPin()\nTogglePin()

Initialized --> InterruptConfigured : EnableInterrupt()\n[Register callback]

InterruptConfigured --> Initialized : DisableInterrupt()\n[Clear callback]

InterruptConfigured --> InterruptConfigured : WritePin()\nReadPin()\nTogglePin()\n[State changes trigger ISR]

note right of InterruptConfigured
  Pin with interrupt enabled
  Can execute callback on edge
  Still supports standard I/O
end note
@enduml
